Button
------

There is a PROG button for flashing firmware. Normally when programming with ESP-IDF, the idf software can automatically let the product enter firmware flashing mode. 

But if you need to avoid the P4 entering normal mode, you can press and hold the PROG button while powering on or resetting the product. This is helpful when you want to update the C6 firmware and prevent the P4 from communicating with the C6 (WiFi/Bluetooth).

